 solutions in a global and societal context.", "Students' should gain a knowledge of contemporary issues."], "acadCareer": "GR", "acadGroup": "EN", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": null}, {"strm": 2727, "crseId": 368701, "crseOfferNbr": 2, "subject": "ENMGT", "catalogNbr": "6091", "titleShort": "Seminar: Project Mgmt", "titleLong": "Seminar: Project Management", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "SEM", "ssrComponentLong": "Seminar", "section": "101", "classNbr": 16242, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "04:30PM", "timeEnd": "05:30PM", "startDt": "01/22/2019", "endDt": "05/07/2019", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 1, "netid": "fmv3", "firstName": "Francis", "middleName": "M.", "lastName": "Vanek"}], "pattern": "M", "facilityDescr": "Hollister Hall 366", "bldgDescr": "Hollister Hall", "facilityDescrshort": "HLS366", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}], "notes": [], "campus": "MAIN", "campusDescr": "Ithaca", "location": "ITH", "locationDescr": "Ithaca, NY (Main Campus)", "startDt": "01/22/2019", "endDt": "05/07/2019", "addConsent": "N", "addConsentDescr": "No Special Consent Required", "isComponentGraded": true, "crseAttrs": [], "instructionMode": "P", "instrModeDescrshort": "In Person", "instrModeDescr": "In Person", "topicDescription": "", "openStatus": "O", "exploreCriteriaIds": null, "materials": []}], "unitsMinimum": 1, "unitsMaximum": 1, "componentsOptional": [], "componentsRequired": ["SEM"], "gradingBasis": "SUI", "gradingBasisShort": "S/U NoAud", "gradingBasisLong": "Satisfactory/Unsatisfactory (no audit)", "simpleCombinations": [{"subject": "CEE", "catalogNbr": "6091", "type": "C"}], "sessionCode": "1", "sessionBeginDt": "01/22/2019", "sessionEndDt": "05/07/2019", "sessionLong": "Regular Academic Session", "exploreCriteriaIds": null}], "description": "Weekly seminar aimed at M.Eng students, in particular in the engineering management program. Weekly speaker will come from 